    #########################
    #  Experimental source  #
    #########################

save_experimental_source
   _Saveframe_category   experimental_source


   loop_
      _Mol_label
      _Production_method
      _Host_organism_name_common
      _Genus
      _Species
      _Strain
      _Vector_name
      _Details

      $smMLCKp 'recombinant technology' 'E. coli' . . . . 
;
Peptide is produced in an E. coli overexpression
system (described in the associated Biochemistry
paper) and therfore is unmodified at the terminii.
Often, studies of the smMLCKp peptide interacting
with calmodulin are performed using chemically
synthesized peptide.
; 
      $CaM     'recombinant technology'  .        . . . .  . 

   stop_

save_


